互いの胸をくっつけている様子を描いていただきたいです…！\n\n頬が紅潮し、お互いの口が唾液の糸で繋がっていて、「キスした後なんだな…」とわかる表情でお願いします。\nそしてもちろん爆乳で！！！！！\n\n大体の内容を記載しましたが、曖昧であったり分かりづらい部分は大焔さんにお任せいたします。\n\nお忙しい中恐れ入りますが、何卒よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lHQCAywEB610Qef6EyWq-1Np2EXEcBtn", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 29867, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "カサコ🫠お仕事募集中", "screen_name": "kasakasako", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1755115477519720449/9kvR6WlP.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/68173151/1690614892/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 208029, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "カノト", "screen_name": "kanoto_usp", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1957808288751665152/ziMTUscM.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 381184, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "ねこ＠るこ", "screen_name": "nac02", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1693238571770216449/CON20LVm.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/29738555/1744289315/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "acc